{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43022","headline":"广州王园寺伏日即事寄北中亲友 · 王言史","name":"广州王园寺伏日即事寄北中亲友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南越逢初伏，东林度一朝。\n曲池煎畏景，高阁绝微飙。\n竹簟移先洒，蒲葵破复摇。\n地偏毛瘴近，山毒火威饶。\n裛汗絺如濯，亲牀枕并烧。\n堕枝伤翠羽，萎叶惜红蕉。\n且困流金炽，难成独酌谣。\n望霖窥润础，思吹候纤条。\n旅恨生乌浒，乡心系浴桥。\n谁怜在炎客，一夕壮容销。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王言史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43022.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43022","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}